OL,3,AOne killed and four injured in
OL,4,AWashington DC shooting as police
OL,5,Aconfirm suspect also dead
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne person has been killed and four
OL,8,Fmore injured in a shooting in central
OL,9,FWashington DC
OL,11,FPolice say one of the victims is in a
OL,12,Fcritical condition and the others have
OL,13,Fnon life-threatening injuries - here's
OL,14,Fwhat else we know
OL,16,FThe suspect - a white male - is dead;
OL,17,Fauthorities previously said he appeared
OL,18,Fto have a "self-inflicted gunshot
OL,19,Fwound" after barricading himself inside
OL,20,Fa building
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
